; Pasture3D Water — Pond preset. Spec §6.
;
; The cheapest variant, and the versatility payoff: a pond is genuinely less work
; for the GPU, not the same shader tinted differently. No scattering, no crest
; foam, no shadow receive — all compiled out.
;
; Drop it on any MeshInstance3D. No plugin, no Pasture3D node, no wiring (G6): it
; draws the fBm reference waves. On a Pasture3DPool it draws the pond_still profile.
;
; sun_roughness is low because a pond's sea is small: Garrett's sun term spreads
; the highlight by roughness alone, and the ocean's 0.075 smeared a millpond's
; glint across the whole surface.
[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=3 format=3]

